[11.129387,"o"," with amount\r\r\n             0.\r\r\n  S02  tx 1  cancel offer 847505: sells 0.0000002 DUSTC for DUSTB\r\r\n             why: Open offer 847505 sells 0.0000002 DUSTC for DUSTB. Offers are subentries that block the merge, and\r\r\n             their liabilities stop the balance from moving and the trustline from being removed; it is cancelled with\r\r\n             amount 0.\r\r\n  S03  tx 1  return 0.0000003 DUSTB to issuer GB2U...ORKS (burn)\r\r\n             why: Horizon found no strict-send path to XLM for the full balance. Pay the 0.0000003 DUSTB back to its\r\r\n             issuer GB2UESEQQDBE5MEIW3KMNTP67IMCICXBDKBDM6RQZ7UGXOOORG32ORKS, which burns it.\r\r\n  S04  tx 1  remove trustline DUSTB\r\r\n             why: The DUSTB trustline is empty once the balance is disposed of; a trustline is a subentry that blocks\r\r\n             the merge. Removing it (limit 0) releases its 0.5 XLM reserve to this account.\r\r\n  S05  tx 1  return 0.0000005 DUSTC to issuer GB2U...ORKS (burn)\r\r\n             why: Horizon found no strict-send path to XL"]
