[11.145442,"o","BVWMNVBS4MHBXW5IT3KGK3EHP3JTIILR44RJCKJWG, not to this account.\r\r\n  S09  tx 1  delete data entry \"dustin.fixture\"\r\r\n             why: Data entry \"dustin.fixture\" is a subentry that blocks the merge; a manage-data operation without a\r\r\n             value deletes it.\r\r\n  S10  tx 2  sell 0.0000007 DUSTA for XLM: path payment, quote 0.0000007, at least 0.0000006\r\r\n             why: Sell the full 0.0000007 DUSTA for about 0.0000007 XLM (at least 0.0000006) with a strict-send path\r\r\n             payment to this account; the XLM leaves with the merge. It runs in its own transaction so a moved market\r\r\n             cannot roll back the rest.\r\r\n  S11  tx 2  remove trustline DUSTA\r\r\n             why: The DUSTA trustline is empty once the balance is disposed of; a trustline is a subentry that blocks\r\r\n             the merge. Removing it (limit 0) releases its 0.5 XLM reserve to this account.\r\r\n  S12  tx 3  merge into GCBM...KYUA (cannot be undone)\r\r\n             why: Every subentry is removed by the earlier steps; the a"]
