[11.148222,"o","ors nothing, is not immutable and the\r\r\n             destination exists. The merge sends the whole XLM balance to\r\r\n             GCBM3FL3BHBJ25SMZZ2M3IA6EY3UVP24XLLJD2CR6P4KPCCS4FRCKYUA and deletes the account. It cannot be undone.\r\r\n\r\r\nTransactions (3, each fee-bumped by the sponsor; inner fee 0)\r\r\n  tx 1  cleanup    9 ops   bid 419,140 stroops\r\r\n             Deterministic cleanup with no market dependency (offer cancellations, returns to issuers, transfers to the\r\r\n             destination, removal of emptied trustlines and data entries), grouped into one fee-bumped transaction of at\r\r\n             most 100 operations.\r\r\n  tx 2  convert    2 ops   bid 125,742 stroops\r\r\n             Market-dependent sale of DUSTA isolated with its trustline removal, so a moved market cannot roll back the\r\r\n             rest of the close.\r\r\n  tx 3  merge      1 op    bid 83,828 stroops\r\r\n             The merge runs alone after a fresh preflight, because the path payments before it depend on the market and\r\r\n             could"]
